<title>BRAZIL: Brazil BR Jan-Sept net down at $99.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Brazil BR Jan-Sept net down at $99.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian fuel distributor Petrobras Distribuidora (BR), a subsidiary of state oil monopoly Petrobras, announced the following results for the January-September period.</p>
<p>			  Jan-September 1996     Jan-September 1995</p>
<p> Net per share		  n/a			 n/a</p>
<p> Net			    $99.3 million		  $158.6 million</p>
<p> Gross revenue		$6.437 bln		 $6.088 bln</p>
<p>Note: all figures are in U.S. dollars -- Simona de Logu, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
